--- !u!114 &1801507424
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1801507421}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3657e2f003b414db8a003fa92288d2e3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SimpleDialogueManager
  speakerNameText: {fileID: 108899287}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1246487097}
  lines:
  - speakerName: 
    dialogueText: 'Spotlight on this huge 50 seat circle conference table. Leaders
      from 50 countries occupy each seat. '
  - speakerName: 
    dialogueText: 'The leaders start meeting of talking calm and collective.  An
      hour goes by and the meeting starts to become heated. Leaders are to become
      unruly.  '
  - speakerName: 
    dialogueText: 'The president of the committee slaps a book down the table gaining
      looks from everyone.  '
  - speakerName: 'President '
    dialogueText: Fellow ladies and gentlemen of the Highs Court Committee.Why are
      we being barbaric? This is the HCC, we must handle conflict on THE COURT.
  - speakerName: 
    dialogueText: 'Two teams are left out of 50 teams. One of the players is from
      a city in the U.S called Vantage. The announcer calls out the second player
      from a small city in some Opposing Country. '
  - speakerName: 
    dialogueText: Before the match started the leader from Opposing Country grabs
      the tennis player from their country and pulls them to the side.
  - speakerName: 'Opposing Country Leader '
    dialogueText: "(harshly)\nYou better play like you life depends on it. \n"
  - speakerName: Announcer
    dialogueText: '(exhilarated)

      Ladies and gentleman welcome to the last
      match of the HCC World Tennis Tournament. U.S are you ready?

'
  - speakerName: 'U.S player '
    dialogueText: 'Hell yeah!!

'
  - speakerName: Announcer
    dialogueText: Opposing Country are you ready?
  - speakerName: Announcer
    dialogueText: Opposing Country?
  - speakerName: 'Opposing country player '
    dialogueText: '(timidly)

      Y-yeah.

'
  - speakerName: Announcer
    dialogueText: Looks like Opposing Country isn't so confident in their victory
      like the U.S.
  - speakerName: 
    dialogueText: 'The match starts and Opposing Country was to a horrible start.
      The Opposing Country player was missing all his serves and hitting the ball
      out of bounds. After after 90 minutes the U.S came out victorious. '
  - speakerName: Announcer
    dialogueText: The U.S has won!!!!!
  - speakerName: 
    dialogueText: 'Opposing Country''s leader gets really red then stomps away to
      leave the stadium. A helicopter lands outside the stadium to pick him up. When
      he is in the helicopter the pilot hands him a detonator. '
  - speakerName: 
    dialogueText: The leader takes one last look at the stadium.
  - speakerName: Opposing Country Leader
    dialogueText: '(mischievous laugh)

      I guess your life wasn''t important.

'
  - speakerName: News Women
    dialogueText: 'After recent events the members of the HCC who didn''t attend
      the tournament held a emergency meeting to address today bombing. After this
      meeting they came to the conclusion to ban tennis worldwide. '
  - speakerName: News Women
    dialogueText: 'This means anyone caught playing tennis will be sent to jail.
      We must root out this current evil and return to the dealing with issue more
      diplomatically. '
  - speakerName: Lilith
    dialogueText: M-m-mommy?
  typingSpeed: 0.03
